<title>JAPAN: Tada to brief media on court protection.</title>
<headline>Tada to brief media on court protection.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Major Japanese construction firm Tada Corp said on Wednesday that it would hold a news conference at 6 p.m. (0900 GMT) on its application for court protection under Japanese bankruptcy laws.</p>
</text>
